{"id":"74c3063d074d3786","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-universal-tm.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine","display":"prop-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-universal-tm","aliases":["88-prop-universal-tm"],"display":"prop-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[88-df-universal-tm]]","[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-tm-output]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]","[[88-df-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-universal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-universal-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1ac75150a2814e24\" href=\"?note=1ac75150a2814e24\" title=\"88-df-alphabet\">88-df-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective enumeration of binary-input Turing machines)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing-machine class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (universality predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为候选公共输出字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^*\">\\(\\Delta^*\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 上的有限词集。它不要求等于任一机器的纸带字母表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a>；有限字母表与有限词类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1ac75150a2814e24\" href=\"?note=1ac75150a2814e24\" title=\"88-df-alphabet\">88-df-alphabet</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a> 的停机谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 的固定输入词编码，一元输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)\\)</span> 按上述一元约定解释。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|\\Delta|&lt;\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\to\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\in\\Delta^*)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|\\Delta|&lt;\\aleph_0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\to\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\in\\Delta^*)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>根据有效描述计算目标机器并逐步模拟，其工作纸带符号可在通用机的有限工作字母表中编码。目标停机后，把其输出按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 的有限符号表逐字写回，所以原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}\\)</span> 的输出等式得到保留。</p>\n<p>公共有限输出字母表不是可省略的装饰条件：任一固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 只能实际输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_U\\setminus\\{B_U\\}\">\\(\\Gamma_U\\setminus\\{B_U\\}\\)</span> 中的有限多个符号。若原族覆盖输出任意自然数符号的所有机器，则不存在满足原有逐字输出等式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>。本修订没有把输出改成另一个编码，也没有把原机器模型改成统一纸带字母表；它在存在命题上写出真正的适用前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-universal-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-output","status":"resolved","id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-output]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","status":"re