输入 $\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)$ 按上述一元约定解释。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)$ 使用 [[88-df-tm-halts]] 的停机谓词；$\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$ 使用 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定输入词编码，一元输入 $\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)$ 按上述一元约定解释。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Output}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}universal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land|\\Delta|<\\aleph_0\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\to\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\in\\Delta^*)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_U\\setminus\\{B_U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":2455,"backlinks":[{"id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本原子只定义通用性谓词；通用机的存在性由 [[88-prop-universal-tm]] 断言。"}],"outgoing":["74864270657b435d","e0bc676c7a4a4b11","a93cc0702f1280f5","fff1247dc8d93b4d","3b05ff7db230d81f","c5514506c707c9ae","1ac75150a